{{!
	Closing half of the pinnable element wrapper: closes the single div element
	that PinnableElement/Open.mustache opens.
	Consumes no template data keys, so this partial renders identically for every
	context and never needs one.
	This template must be used with PinnableElement/Open to avoid unclosed HTML tags;
	emitted on its own it produces unbalanced HTML. Its consumers are Appearance,
	MainMenu, PageTools and TableOfContents, each pairing exactly one Open with
	exactly one Close. The surrounding pinned or unpinned container is a separate
	element, closed by PinnableContainer/Close.
}}
</div>
